{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1770, "text": "Well, read them and weep. $50 fine and\ntime served."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 11270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7350, "text": "Littering, loitering, trespassing. Mac,\nwe're in a rut."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 14190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11510, "text": "Where have all the interesting cases\ngone?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 31150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25830, "text": "Sumo wrestlers again?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 37250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33110, "text": "Next case, sir, people versus Fujiyama\nand Ohiro."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 44290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38650, "text": "Your Honor, according to witnesses, the\nCheek So Plenty twins here are"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 47970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44290, "text": "giving a sumo exhibition."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 51670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48650, "text": "Mr. Hall was in attendance and\napparently got very upset when he"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 52970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51670, "text": "wasn't a regular wrestling match."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 57950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53250, "text": "No choking, no biting, no gouging, not\none ounce of blood."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 60760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58560, "text": "What has the world of sport come to?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 65680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61880, "text": "Then Mr. Hall jumped into the ring and\ncalled them tubby sissies."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 73480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67180, "text": "I... I think that our friends took\numbrage to that comment. Your Honor,"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 74580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73480, "text": "men don't speak any English."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 75880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74880, "text": "None at all?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 77060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76060, "text": "Pop and taco."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 80180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78980, "text": "Egg McMuffin."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 83500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82180, "text": "Also pancakes."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 87220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85380, "text": "Ah, the language of love."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 89620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88620, "text": "speak Japanese?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 95520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94440, "text": "Anyone else?"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 99460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96820, "text": "Mac? They're just so darn cute."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 103220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101200, "text": "Mac? Making some calls, sir."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 107080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104440, "text": "We're going to have to hold this one\nover until we can find an interpreter,"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 108219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107220, "text": "folks."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 111200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108220, "text": "Boy, you want to take these guys out and\nsee if you can find them something to"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 113660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111200, "text": "eat? Hey, how about some sushi?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 115260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114260, "text": "Raw fish."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 128590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126410, "text": "Now, listen, I have planned the perfect\nevening for us."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 134290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129090, "text": "We're going to toast with Dom Perignon,\nhave some chilled cracked crab, and then"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 136850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134290, "text": "listen to some boss tunes on my new\ncompact disc."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 139550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137750, "text": "Why don't we just jump into bed?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 141830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140550, "text": "Well, there's another option."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 145010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143290, "text": "And a mighty fine one at that."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 147850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145930, "text": "What are you going to do about it,\nDanny?"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 149690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148470, "text": "I'm going to chill you."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 154170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150350, "text": "I'm going to thrill you. I'm going to\nmake the earth move."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 173870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172330, "text": "That was with my shoes on."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 222490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218350, "text": "That rumbling you felt a few minutes ago\nwas a 5 .5 earthquake centered in lower"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 227090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222490, "text": "Manhattan. That's crazy. There are no\nearthquakes in New York. Our city has"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 228090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227090, "text": "a number of tremors before."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 230850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228450, "text": "When? The last was 1984."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 236090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232750, "text": "While there may be aftershocks, there is\nno reason to panic."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 239630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236430, "text": "What? I said there's no reason to panic."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 242230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241230, "text": "Hi, everyone."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 243510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242270, "text": "Hey, Art, how is everything?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 244970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243970, "text": "Not too bad."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 247230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245110, "text": "My mother's lumbago is acting up again."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 250120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248000, "text": "You know, she's not as young as she used\nto be, sir. Art!"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 252120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250620, "text": "How is everything here?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 255460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252980, "text": "Rotten. We just had a nice quick here,\nyou know."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 258540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256079, "text": "If there's another, I suggest we take\nrefuge in his skull."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 263260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260640, "text": "There wasn't too much damage, though,\nYour Honor, except for a minor problem"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 264019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263260, "text": "with the stairs."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 265080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264020, "text": "What's the problem with the stairs?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 266420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265420, "text": "They're gone."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 268939, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268040, "text": "They're gone?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 270060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268940, "text": "The stairs are gone?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 271640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270640, "text": "What are we going to do?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 274520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272060, "text": "If I could be so bold, I'd suggest you\nuse the elevator."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 277140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276140, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 279520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278200, "text": "Mr. Potato Head."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 285040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281460, "text": "Sir, this is Miss Linda Egan. Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 288520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285280, "text": "And her students, Ernie, Mary, and Chad."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 291860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289160, "text": "They get to spend the night in the\ncourtroom because they won their student"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 292860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291860, "text": "government contest."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 294900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293120, "text": "It's an honor to meet you, Judge."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 296580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295260, "text": "Hey, the pleasure's all mine."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 298000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297000, "text": "Out!"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 300840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299240, "text": "What other sucker's that?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 304640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303380, "text": "That's very funny, Ernie."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 308590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305290, "text": "And I'm sure I'm going to appreciate it\na lot more if I ever get the feeling"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 309590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308590, "text": "back in my head."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 311290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310250, "text": "Ernie the buzzer."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 313890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311870, "text": "I'm sorry, Your Honor. It won't happen\nagain."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 316930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315610, "text": "Mary? I'm Christine."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 318710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317150, "text": "I couldn't help but notice your badge."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 323130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319010, "text": "Are you a campfire girl? Yes, ma 'am.\nAre you a campfire girl, too? For four"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 324170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323130, "text": "wonderful years."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 328250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325470, "text": "Lady, I'd give ten bucks to see you in\nyour old uniform."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 333250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330930, "text": "Chad. Chad, it would only come to here."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 334900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333900, "text": "Okay, 20."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 340520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338120, "text": "Come on. I'll find you guys front row\nseats."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 345220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341780, "text": "Next case, sir. People versus DeVries\nand Parker."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 350400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346060, "text": "Okay, kids, this is what is called an\narraignment. Now, I want you to pay very"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 356320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350400, "text": "close attention as I ask the prosecutor\nhere exactly what the charge is."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 358380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356660, "text": "They were performing a live sex act,\nsir."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 363180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360580, "text": "Mr. Segan, what's a live sex act?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 368700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364680, "text": "Well, Mary, we'll discuss that on career\nday."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 374960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371360, "text": "Uh, sir, I don't think this is the case.\nWe should be trying in front of"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 375779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374960, "text": "innocent children."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 376980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375780, "text": "Right. What else we got, Mac?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 379100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377220, "text": "New satanic rituals, sir."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 381460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380460, "text": "Anything else?"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 382720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381660, "text": "Wife swap meet."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 388620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384380, "text": "Well, like I said, we'll proceed with\nthis one as best we can, trying to use"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 389620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388620, "text": "utmost discretion."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 391360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390360, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 400120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397040, "text": "The defendants are charged with playing\ndoctor."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 404420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401780, "text": "Very good. Apparently it was an\nexploratory surgery."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 412240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408720, "text": "Sir, perhaps the children should be\nexcused. Mr."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 415820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412480, "text": "Prosecutor, does this get much worse\nbefore it gets any better?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 419260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416120, "text": "Well, sir, I was about to introduce the\nstage props into evidence."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 421300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419960, "text": "Please, God, no."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 424860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421840, "text": "If you have any shred of decency, you'll\nstop right there."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 428140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426700, "text": "As I was saying, exhibit A."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 432660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431360, "text": "Oh, take him to holding."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 434100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433100, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 436359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435480, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 440340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436360, "text": "The guy upstairs speaks some Japanese,\nso I'm going to run slim and tiny up"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 441340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440340, "text": "there, okay?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 446780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443940, "text": "Where will these people learn the right\ntool for the right job?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 453760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449280, "text": "Dan, why don't you take those props up\nto evidence, huh? Right."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 455680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454680, "text": "And, uh, Dan?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 457560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456560, "text": "No souvenirs."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 460300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459300, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 464760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462860, "text": "Want to see a card trick, Judge?"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 470340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465340, "text": "Oh, well, Ernie, I'm afraid that a card\ntrick that I haven't already seen has"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 471340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470340, "text": "yet to be invented."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 472840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471840, "text": "Hear me."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 474580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473400, "text": "Pick a card."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 476240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475240, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 478480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477480, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 480880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479440, "text": "It hurts, right?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 484860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482960, "text": "That's a real good trick, Ernie."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 489640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485960, "text": "I'd like to show you a little trick. It\ninvolves pliers and fingernails."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 493020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491480, "text": "Oh, not another one."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 495820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493980, "text": "Everybody just try to stay calm."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 497740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496740, "text": "How you doing, Judge?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 499720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498060, "text": "All right, Art, what's the bad news?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 502100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500120, "text": "Well, my bowling team didn't make the\nfinals again."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 504940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502920, "text": "I know it's not the end of the world,\nbut... Art!"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 510760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506760, "text": "There was another tremor. I know. That's\nhow those people got trapped in the"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 513159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510760, "text": "elevator. People trapped in an elevator?"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 514740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513500, "text": "Are they in any danger?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 516159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515159, "text": "Of course not."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 519440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516559, "text": "Unless you exceed the maximum weight\ncapacity for the elevator."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 527080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525640, "text": "This could take a while."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 530000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527960, "text": "I guess we'll just have to entertain\nourselves."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 542380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541020, "text": "Any way we can."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 550870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549130, "text": "to get you out of there, so stay calm."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 553670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551310, "text": "I promise you, everything's gonna be\njust fine."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 556570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555190, "text": "Unless you run out of air."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 563330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561650, "text": "Thank you, Mr. Wizard."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 568790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566610, "text": "We gotta find somebody that speaks\nJapanese."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 570490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569490, "text": "How tall?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 575890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574890, "text": "Five -seven."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 577150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576150, "text": "Good choice."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 582390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580970, "text": "department's all tied up with\nemergencies."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 583930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582590, "text": "They won't be here for hours."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 585130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584130, "text": "Oh, wonderful."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 589330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585390, "text": "All right, all right. In the meantime,\nwe've got to gather together some"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 593210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589330, "text": "supplies. We'll need some gauze and some\nbandages and some rubber tubing for"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 594890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593210, "text": "tourniquets and a couple of pints of\nwhole blood."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 596730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595150, "text": "I'll just bring Dan's briefcase."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 603110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598690, "text": "I just checked the elevator shaft. The\ncables are fine. The car's just jammed"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 606810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603110, "text": "there. Art, there are four people in\nthat car. Now, are you sure that's not"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 607529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606810, "text": "much weight?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 609050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607530, "text": "I'm positive. It's no problem."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 613790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609270, "text": "Good. Unless they're sumo wrestlers or\nsomething."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 620490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619490, "text": "This is great."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 623950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621410, "text": "This elevator doesn't even have an\nemergency phone in it."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 630210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625570, "text": "Oh, my God, look at this. This elevator\nunsafe for weights exceeding 1 ,000"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 631210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630210, "text": "pounds."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 636110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635110, "text": "320."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 639870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637630, "text": "350. And, Raj, you go about..."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 641360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640140, "text": "115. 115."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 651500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648580, "text": "I see. So the uniform weighs, what, 70,\n80 pounds?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 654460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653460, "text": "Cute fielding."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 658240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655020, "text": "Listen, what if the air runs out in\nhere? How have we been stuck in this"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 659240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658240, "text": "for over nine hours?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 661520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660240, "text": "It's been eight minutes."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 670550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668010, "text": "I'm going to be squished to a liquid\npulp. I'm going to die."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 672810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671350, "text": "Fielding, it's not a tremor."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 675310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673190, "text": "Now, where's that horrible rumbling\nnoise coming from?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 677750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676110, "text": "I think from somewhere in there."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 681490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680490, "text": "Hungry."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 684670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682730, "text": "Let's hope they never heard of the\nDonner Party."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 696430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690730, "text": "Don't let on. I have a pack of C -H -U\n-C -K -L -E -S."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 710030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708110, "text": "What do you think he's saying?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 713570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710490, "text": "I don't know, but I think it's something\nabout singing soprano in the Vienna"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 714570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713570, "text": "Boys Choir."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 722330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720730, "text": "You know, Mr. Egan, I envy you."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 726910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722630, "text": "It must be so rewarding being a\nschoolteacher, watching those"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 730170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727310, "text": "Smiling faces, eagerly searching out\nlife's mysteries."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 733530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730490, "text": "Chad is trying to peek up your dress\nwith mirrors on his shoe."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 736030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735030, "text": "Chad!"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 741410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738230, "text": "Judge, would you look at my calculator?\nI think it's broken."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 744190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741870, "text": "Yeah. Well, I don't know. It looks..."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 758820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754320, "text": "are one clever kid. In fact, I bet if I\nput you in handcuffs and threw you in a"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 762020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758820, "text": "tank of water, you could get out in,\nwhat, 25, 30 minutes, huh?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 765040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764040, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 768860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767740, "text": "that wasn't so bad."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 772840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769640, "text": "I guess you sort of get used to these\nthings after a while, huh?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 780140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778600, "text": "And they said it wouldn't last."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 785710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782990, "text": "Yeah, go ahead. Keep making jokes. I\nwant to die with a smile on my face."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 787590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786450, "text": "Fielding relax, okay?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 789110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787830, "text": "Do not tell me what to do."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 793050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789590, "text": "If I want to be ordered around by\nsomebody wearing a paramilitary uniform,"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 794050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793050, "text": "pay for it, okay?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 797130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796130, "text": "You're losing it."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 798530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797450, "text": "I'm not losing anything."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 800730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799590, "text": "Except maybe my chuckles."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 803090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802070, "text": "I've got to get out of here."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 805950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803810, "text": "I know what. I'm going to go out that\ndoor and shimmy up those cables."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 807470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806470, "text": "Sit down."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 809630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808630, "text": "Oh, what?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 812200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810380, "text": "or I'll make you sit down."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 817820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814340, "text": "You're going to make me sit down? You\nare going to make me sit down?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 825720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822020, "text": "Any questions?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 831660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830660, "text": "Don't you see?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 837320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831960, "text": "If the big one hits, I'll die never\nhaving known the joys of physical love."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 848920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843879, "text": "Chad, I'm getting just a little tired of\nyour endless sleazy suggestions and"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 851160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848920, "text": "your double entendres and your leering\nglances."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 855920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853580, "text": "Did I mention I could stay until nine on\nSaturday?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 862520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861520, "text": "Fool,"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 865679, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864700, "text": "what are you doing?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 866960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865680, "text": "Found your interpreter, sir."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 876640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871000, "text": "excuse me sir do you speak english well"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 882380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876640, "text": "you haven't found an interpreter you\nkidnapped an innocent human being"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 886640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882380, "text": "hope this doesn't go on my record"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 902640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901640, "text": "trick, huh?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 905240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903080, "text": "Ernie, I am not falling for this one."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 910200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905480, "text": "Your Honor, I'm so sorry. Mary was\nvisiting your bench when she got sick."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 916980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913640, "text": "I knew it was real. I knew it was real."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 925720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920800, "text": "Kid, one day, one of these mindless\nlittle pranks of yours is going to"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 927120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925720, "text": "and you're going to be in big trouble."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 929660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927440, "text": "They're childish and they're silly."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 933270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930100, "text": "And why do I feel... like I've heard\nthis speech before."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 937310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934950, "text": "Well, it's the same one I've given you\nabout 20 times."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 943250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938750, "text": "That's the way grown -ups used to talk\nto me when I was a kid. And I acted..."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 948330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943250, "text": "just like him."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 956190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953230, "text": "Oh, God."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 960050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958630, "text": "I was a geek."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 968000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966760, "text": "I got an idea about the elevator."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 969740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968460, "text": "I think it's a brake problem."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 970679, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969940, "text": "What's with the brake?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 971680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970680, "text": "It's in my toolbox."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 976420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972060, "text": "What? They put this new hydraulic system\nin there, and if I retract the engaging"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 978720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976420, "text": "mechanism, I think I can get him out of\nthere."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 981120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979440, "text": "How come I didn't think about this\nsooner?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 982920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981540, "text": "Where the heck was my head?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 990060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985200, "text": "Out of appreciation for your help for\nus, Art, I'm not going to answer that."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1010520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008840, "text": "Isn't that you called my house last\nSaturday night?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1016680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014240, "text": "Do you mind? I'm busy gasping here."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1018900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017540, "text": "Well, gasp quieter."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1020100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019100, "text": "They're sleeping."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1039310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038069, "text": "I'm claustrophobic, all right?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1043250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040010, "text": "You? A man who had sex in a broom\ncloset?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1046310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044770, "text": "I thought it was over like that."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1050350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047730, "text": "Come on, Fielding, you've been in tight\nsituations before."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1052570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051570, "text": "Yeah, you bet."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1056870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053990, "text": "I once spent the whole night in a\ndrainpipe."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1059510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057630, "text": "Too cheap to spring for a motel room?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1063630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061810, "text": "I was eight years old."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1065530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064530, "text": "Why'd you do that?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1067790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066730, "text": "I was on a dare."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1071250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068110, "text": "The other kids thought I was kind of a\ncreep."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1073750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072750, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1078390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075430, "text": "I was supposed to crawl through it under\nthe highway, come out the other side."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1081230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079770, "text": "Right in the middle of it, I got stuck."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1084130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083050, "text": "It was stifling."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1086390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085390, "text": "Suffocating."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1090390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086830, "text": "I just hate being in situations where I\ndo not have control. It's like a big"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1091650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090390, "text": "rock being put on my chest."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1093430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092310, "text": "Like being buried alive."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1094810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093810, "text": "Like I'm drowning."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1099810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095230, "text": "I've got to get out of here. Dan, Dan. I\nwant to get out of here. Dan, there's"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1100890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099810, "text": "nothing to be frightened of."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1102930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101590, "text": "I'm going to take care of you."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1105290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104290, "text": "Come here."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1106910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105910, "text": "Close your eyes."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1110130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109010, "text": "Close your eyes."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1116450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113210, "text": "I want you to think of a wide open\nspace."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1119350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118130, "text": "It's a football field."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1123990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122210, "text": "There are thousands of people there."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1126680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125100, "text": "Enjoying the fresh, clean air."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1129920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128660, "text": "And you're there too, Dan."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1132520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131480, "text": "You're relaxed."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1135200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134200, "text": "You're smiling."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1138420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137420, "text": "And you're naked."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1146620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145560, "text": "Well, what do you hear?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1148500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147500, "text": "The ocean."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1152620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151540, "text": "Hey, how you doing, Judge?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1154680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153340, "text": "All right, how are things going up\nthere?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1157220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154960, "text": "Terrific. I found that issue of Popular\nMechanics."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1158540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157540, "text": "Yes,"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1160000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159000, "text": "sir?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1161340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160340, "text": "What's with the elevator?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1162439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161740, "text": "It's a go."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1164880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162440, "text": "I released the brakes, double -checked\nthe relays."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1166560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165560, "text": "Everything's copacetic."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1169360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166940, "text": "You mean all we have to do is push the\nbutton and they'll be back down here?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1170980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169600, "text": "I stake my reputation on it."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1172680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171580, "text": "Try it anyway, sir."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1184439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183720, "text": "So what's wrong?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1185440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184440, "text": "It's not moving."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1187480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185680, "text": "I guess the contacts must have burnt\nout."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1189120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187860, "text": "I got just the tool for that."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1197260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196260, "text": "It's moving!"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1199880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197620, "text": "Hey, it's a work of art."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1206460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205160, "text": "All right, come on, big guy."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1209000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206740, "text": "There you go!"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1211520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209620, "text": "You're safe, just like I promised you."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1212880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211740, "text": "Dan, Roz, you all right?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1214830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213830, "text": "Yeah, we're fine."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1216790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215270, "text": "These guys just freaked out a little."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1220150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219070, "text": "They're just big babies."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1223050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221590, "text": "Really big diapers."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1229410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225370, "text": "Uh, Bull, why don't you get these guys\nsome grub and be gentle. I've had quite"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1231110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229410, "text": "shock. Come on, guys."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1233150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231530, "text": "Eat! No eat!"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1234690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233690, "text": "Bathroom!"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1240070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237430, "text": "I think they want to freshen up first."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1246850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243310, "text": "Dan, I must say, I'm proud of you. It\nseems that you showed some leadership in"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1249290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246850, "text": "there. It was nothing."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1252470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249490, "text": "Oh, I don't know. Some people really\nmight have panicked. For sure."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1257570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253690, "text": "Hey, Rod, you must have been pretty\nimpressed with old Dan the man here."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1262730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261730, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1264430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263010, "text": "Dan was a real cool cookie."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1275170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274030, "text": "compliment out of that woman."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1280470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278770, "text": "Soup, apple, and sandwich."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1282910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280870, "text": "That'll be... I'm paying for those guys,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1285470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284230, "text": "$384 .02."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1296730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294630, "text": "You take Chevys?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1303410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300330, "text": "Listen, Ross, I want to tell you how\nmuch I really appreciate you not letting"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1304950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303410, "text": "to the others that really happened in\nthat elevator."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1307710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305770, "text": "I don't want people to know the truth\nabout that."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1311150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309050, "text": "That I was a low -down, nibbling coward?"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1313190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311990, "text": "No, they already know that."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1317070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315210, "text": "I don't want them to know I was nice to\nyou."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1320930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319930, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1323330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321370, "text": "Because then everybody would want to be\nmy friend."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1329590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326250, "text": "Then they'd want to hang around all the\ntime, and sooner or later, two of them"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1333210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329590, "text": "would get into an argument, and I'd have\nto try and cool them off, but I'm not"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1339710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333210, "text": "much good at that, so I'd just gun them\nall down and end up frying in the"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1340710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339710, "text": "electric chair."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1348050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346770, "text": "Better to be safe than sorry."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1351610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350610, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1355450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352230, "text": "goodbye. This has been most interesting."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1358730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356170, "text": "Maybe we can do it again in, say, 40\nyears."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1362230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360270, "text": "Judge, no hard feelings?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1366630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362570, "text": "Hey, no hard feelings at all, Ernie.\nYou're just a young, enthusiastic kid."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1367850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366630, "text": "was a pleasure having you around."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1370590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368190, "text": "Okay. Thanks for everything, Judge. You\nbet."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1376550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375550, "text": "Judge!"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1378870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377870, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1383970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382750, "text": "wonderful third."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1386940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384290, "text": "You just... played a trick that was mean\nand childish and stupid."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1388240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387180, "text": "Does that make you feel better?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1391320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388520, "text": "No. I feel better because I stole his\nwatch."}
